// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - OddDevice 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P3426183549" "Odd Beeping"
// DetailString :
"P2768744171" "After knocking out one of the ghouls, you heard an odd beep come from one of their collars. You picked it up and looked inside of it to see a a red light flashing in a pattern. The flashing stopped after a few moments, as if the source of the flash was turned off."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - EddieNote 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P210249999" "Eddie's Trail"
// DetailString :
"P2876453360" "You noticed that the large ghoul you defeated had several bullet wounds on its back; these were not made during your fight with it. Looking around the area, you can see similar marks around the walls. It seems Eddie <i>was</i> here for a brief amount of time. You'll have to keep moving forward to find him."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - ResistanceReport 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P994145057" "Edward Polstra - Kidnapped"
// DetailString :
"P924333082" "You told Mr. G to let TPN know that Eddie Polstra was kidnapped by the Resistance."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - GhoulsReport 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P3725145547" "The Ghoul Horde"
// DetailString :
"P1487236084" "You told Mr. G to let TPN know that you stopped a horde of Ghouls from entering Imperial City while searching for Eddie Polstra."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - CampaignReport 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P1757031026" "The Great Campaign"
// DetailString :
"P1872999536" "You told Mr. G to let TPN know that in addition to your search for Eddie, you've vowed to start a campaign to make the tunnels in Praetoria safer for the people."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - StaticInfo 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P3390589035" "Resistance Static"
// DetailString :
"P644600255" "You're able to overhear some of the Resistance talking over the Static, though it takes a few minutes for you to translate what they're <i>actually</i> saying. It would appear there's a man here named <color yellow>Dark Watcher</color>. The Resistance doesn't go into detail about who he is or what he wants, but they claim that he's here to, 'help swing the tide against Cole'."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - BrainwashedReport 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P1374320293" "Eddie Polstra - Brainwashed"
// DetailString :
"P257329763" "You told Mr. G to let TPN know that Eddie had been brainwashed by the Resistance, and that you're going to Neuron's lab in Imperial to help cure him."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - LeaderReport 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P763901796" "Resistance Leaders"
// DetailString :
"P323325" "You told Mr. G to let TPN know that you took down several high ranking members of the Resistance during your search for Eddie."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - DeathReport 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P1483786654" "Polstra - Dead?"
// DetailString :
"P3562534292" "You told Mr. G to let TPN know that Eddie Polstra may be considered dead, but that you won't give up until you've gone through every nook and cranny in Imperial City to find him."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - Murderer 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P398990762" "Warrant's Investigation"
// DetailString :
"P409812009" "You ran into Warrant in Neuron's labs and helped him with a group of Syndicate. Afterwards, he explained to you that he was in the labs on an investigation. It appears that several lower members of the Powers Division have turned up dead in the tunnels of Nova and Imperial. The markings on their body suggest they weren't killed by the Resistance."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - HolonLab 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P1207543583" "Haworth and Holon Labs"
// DetailString :
"P2628340602" "You defeated Michael Haworth and found a card in his jacket. It identifies him as the CTO of Halon Labs, a corporation in Imperial City that deals with testing the areas around Praetoria for any signs of Devouring Earth spores."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - Maelstrom 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P3153450033" "The Maelstrom Device"
// DetailString :
"P2448854847" "You scanned through the lab's database and found a document detailing work done on the Maelstrom Device. It appears that there were only two models made; both met unfortunate ends. The first was stolen from the labs after completion some time ago. The second was grafted onto a volunteer from the PPD, though it says that further experiments on melding the device with the agent went awry, causing the experiment to be cancelled. You're still left not knowing <i>who</i> exactly the monster is that Eddie Polstra is chasing, but at least you know now that it's not part of an invasion."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - Murderer 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - HalonLabReport 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P2279650974" "Syndicate and Halon Labs"
// DetailString :
"P3989489957" "You told Mr. G to reveal that Michael Haworth is a member of the Syndicate and that you're on the verge of saving Eddie."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - SelflessReport 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P3583950926" "Kindness of your Heart"
// DetailString :
"P1352156943" "You told Mr. G to inform TPN that you paused your operations to save Eddie in order to stop the Syndicate from invading Neuron's lab."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - WarrantReport 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P1501019635" "The New Team"
// DetailString :
"P45570240" "You told Mr. G to mention to TPN that you and Warrant teamed up to fight off the Syndicate in Neuron's lab."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - CalvinScott 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P2100277598" "Eddie Polstra's True Home"
// DetailString :
"P3311008078" "You spoke with Calvin Scott, who asked that you try to find out from Eddie where he's really from."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// SouvenirClueDef - PersonalMonsterSouvenir 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// SouvenirClueDef Name :
"P2439930493" "Mr. G's Image"
// tDetailString :
"P2864048788" "You don't know why, but sometimes out of the corner of your eye, you can swear you see Mr. G. When you look, you see that no one is there. You can't help but feel that he's still watching you, even after the time you worked with him, which you call...<br><br><color gold>Personal Monster</color><br><br>It began with the news that Eddie Polstra had gone missing. Eddie had become a fairly big name in Imperial City: whoever would save him would become even bigger. You teamed up with Mr. G to look for Eddie with the promise of fame and fortune. You first went into the tunnels of Imperial to find Eddie, though all you found were ghouls and evidence that Eddie was somewhere nearby. You called Mr. G for more information and relayed information on what exactly he should tell the press.<br><br>You pushed further into the tunnels and finally encountered Eddie, only for him to tell you that he would not return to the surface until he found a mythical 'monster' that was the key to some 'invasion'. He also claimed that the beast had the Maelstrom Device, the same technology that was keeping Eddie alive. Eddie teleported away, leaving you back at square one. You spoke again with Mr. G, who proposed an investigation into the Maelstrom Device that was within Eddie's chest.<br><br>You decided to trick the Resistance to attack the lab you were heading to, which would make you look all the better when you swooped in there to save the day. However, instead of the Resistance showing up, you found the Syndicate in the lab. You cleared the lab and found data on the Maelstrom Device, which revealed that only one other was made apart from Eddie's. Whoever gave Eddie the Maelstrom Device had stolen it from Praetoria!<br><br>You were able to track down Eddie once more to tell him the news. This seemed to make a fine impact on him; Eddie agreed to return to the surface with you, saying that the monster was of no more consequence if it was truly from Praetoria. You and Eddie fought off some members of the Resistance whom Mr. G so graciously sent your way.<br><br>When you returned to the surface, the people of Imperial City hailed you as a hero, while Eddie Polstra slowly faded from the public eye. It was your time to shine in Imperial City, and you would be sure to bask in the limelight as long as possible."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - TamiBaker 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P2427312814" "Hello! Tami Baker, at your service. What can I do for you today?"
// Answer Text :
"P1009007857" "I'm {HeroName}. Mr. G said you were expecting me."
// Page InformationPage1 Text :
"P4068010864" "Oh! Yes, of course I was expecting you! Mr. G has told me ALL about you and the work you're doing, all about it! He's pretty confident that Mr. Sinclair will be blown away by all the work that you've done. Unfortunately, Mr. Sinclair is a very busy man; it will be some time until he receives these papers. But I'll make sure to get it to him right away!<br><br>If only he weren't pre-occupied with his own private matters and that of Powers Division, he could get to this sooner! All of Imperial is concerned about it, all of Imperial!"
// Answer Text :
"P1860978623" "Who is this missing Powers Division?"
// Page InformationPage2 Text :
"P3858569375" "His name's <color yellow>Eddie Polstra</color>.<br><br>He was supposed to be our newest and best defense against those Resistance scum. But now he's just vanished - here one day, gone the next! Praetor Sinclair is trying to get an investigation going, but he's busy trying to run several other operations. We've heard rumors that someone is going around killing members of Powers Division, but Praetor Sinclair has ruled out that possibility for Eddie. It's an awful situation, just awful!<br><br>The people of the city are crying out for someone to save this poor member of Powers Division!<br><br><color orange>Eddie Polstra seems to have gotten in over his head. If Tami Baker's information is true, the people of Imperial City are concerned about Eddie's safety, including Praetor Sinclair. This could be the perfect time for you to swoop in and make a name for yourself in Imperial. Saving Eddie Polstra will open a lot of doors for you to gain more power and fame within Imperial; you might even be able to show up Praetor Sinclair! It would be best to speak with Mr. G and see what exactly he can do to help you with this assignment."
// Answer Text :
"P4160897004" "Thanks for the information, Tami. I'll be on my way."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1156117236" "Very good to see you, {HeroName}, very good. I believe you and I have a great deal of work ahead of us. Before we begin, I would like to make a request. There is a woman by the name of <color yellow>Tami Baker</color>. She is the capable secretary of <color yellow>Praetor Sinclair</color>, very capable.<br><br>I would like you to deliver this package to her. It contains the details of your previous exploits here in Praetoria. Nothing too revealing, just enough to make you look good, very good. This is going to be given to Praetor Sinclair, personally. It will take some time for this to reach him, but I believe by that time you will have achieved enough power and fame that nothing else would be required to convince Praetor Sinclair of your stature.<br><br>Do you mind doing this small task for me, {HeroName}?"
// AcceptString :
"P4095092417" "(Take the Package.)"
// SendOffString :
"P777610649" "Perfect.<br><br><color orange>Mr. G hands you a small package. It feels as if there are numerous stacks of paper in here, all filled with reports on your exploits.</color><br><br>Ms. Baker will expecting you, quite expecting you."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2433444752" "Meet with Tami Baker"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1687951828" "Have you met with Ms. Baker yet?"
// TaskTitle :
"P477734471" "<color deepskyblue>Personal Monster</color>"
// TaskSubTitle :
"P2398171299" "<color deepskyblue>Part One: The Girl Called Baker</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3370787595" "You delivered the package to Tami Baker and discovered that Eddie Polstra has gone missing."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3944354324" "Back from speaking with Ms. Baker? Hrm, Mr. Polstra? Yes, I'm familiar with his untimely disappearance.<br><br>You wish to uncover his whereabouts, {HeroName}? Yes, I can help you with that, I can definitely help you with that. This is the reason why I wanted to work with you, {HeroName}, you are a proactive being, very proactive. An opportunity presents itself and you seize it.<br><br>I just so happen to have some interests in Mr. Polstra. I can see this operation benefitting both of our goals, yes, very much benefitting both of us.<br><br>Here, this is my personal contact information. You can reach me at any time. Most need to go through my secretary, but I believe you and I are far past that point."
// RandomFameString :
"P856364347" ""

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - MrGTask1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P1847321583" "<color deepskyblue>Personal Monster</color><br><br><color deepskyblue>Part Three: Polstra's Crusade</color><br><br>{HeroName}, good to see you're still alive. I didn't think the ghouls would best you, but you can never be too careful. What information do you have?"
// Answer Text :
"P3190964210" "I'm on Eddie's trail, but I need some more help with his exact location."
// Page InformationPage1 Text :
"P1367651839" "<color deepskyblue>Personal Monster</color><br><br><color deepskyblue>Part Three: Polstra's Crusade</color><br><br>{HeroName}, I've got the information you need, just the right information. My sources tell me Mr. Polstra's location should be in the tunnels nearby. Here are the rough coordinates. Do be careful, however. I've pooled together information from many of my own contacts, and it would appear that Eddie went through a group of Resistance.<br><br>By the way, TPN aired the initial report that you were looking for Eddie. They're looking to get another statement about your progress. What shall I divulge to those good reporters? We'll need something short for them to ponder on."
// Answer Text :
"P2980255257" "Tell them I believe Eddie has been kidnapped by the Resistance."
// Answer Text :
"P505854606" "Tell them that I stopped a horde of ghouls from getting into Imperial City."
// Answer Text :
"P1703879068" "Tell them that I vow to start a campaign to make the tunnels safer for the people."
// Page Resistance Text :
"P3807224511" "<color deepskyblue>Personal Monster</color><br><br><color deepskyblue>Part Three: Polstra's Crusade</color><br><br>Very well, I'll spread the word that Eddie has been captured by members of the Resistance."
// Answer Text :
"P4075975971" "Excellent. I'll be on my way."
// Page Ghouls Text :
"P586484012" "<color deepskyblue>Personal Monster</color><br><br><color deepskyblue>Part Three: Polstra's Crusade</color><br><br>Ghouls? Interesting way to get the blood going, very interesting. I'll let TPN know of the threat that you stopped while looking for Eddie."
// Page Campaign Text :
"P948429875" "<color deepskyblue>Personal Monster</color><br><br><color deepskyblue>Part Three: Polstra's Crusade</color><br><br>That's very spirited of you {HeroName}, very spirited. I'll let those reporters know of your noble campaign to keep all the people of Praetoria safe from those monsters."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - TalkOne 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P2208933163" "You? Who are you? Wait... I've heard of you. {HeroName}.<br><br>What are you doing down here? They send you to 'save' me?"
// Answer Text :
"P893003526" "I sent myself. What are you doing down here?"
// Page InformationPage1 Text :
"P3922110076" "The monster, {HeroName}! They're trying to <i>invade</i> us. I saw it myself. I'm not going to rest until I track it down. If it is what I think it is, then it could mean that great destruction is on the horizon for Praetoria. I'm not going to let that happen."
// Answer Text :
"P3073100597" "Calm down. What monster? What are you talking about?"
// Page InformationPage2 Text :
"P2254043894" "Do you see my chest? This is a <color yellow>Maelstrom Device</color>. It was made by the people back where I'm from and <i>only</i> where I'm from.<br><br>I was patrolling in the sewers, looking for these Resistance scum, when I came across this <i>monster</i>. It was at least the size of five ghouls, {HeroName}. And it had <i>my</i> Maelstrom Device attached to its chest! The beast and I fought, though it knew the tunnels better than I and got away.<br><br>I can't rest until I find the monster, {HeroName}, it's the first sign of an invasion here, an invasion I have to stop!"
// Answer Text :
"P1029181321" "Look, Eddie, we can figure this out. Just come back to the surface with me."
// Page WithMe Text :
"P4224322344" "I'm not going anywhere, {HeroName}. I'm not going to rest until this monster, and the invasion, are stopped!<br><br><color orange>Eddie pushes a button, activating a teleporter!</color>"
// Answer Text :
"P4006089059" "... great."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - MrGTask3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P3128928907" "<color deepskyblue>Personal Monster</color><br><br><color deepskyblue>Part Four: Your Own Personal Hero</color><br><br>{HeroName}, interesting timing, very interesting. TPN just finished their report about your progress.<br><br>Were you able to find Eddie?"
// Answer Text :
"P1000052829" "In a way. He's chasing some sort of monster."
// Page InformationPage1 Text :
"P4076115183" "<color deepskyblue>Personal Monster</color><br><br><color deepskyblue>Part Four: Your Own Personal Hero</color><br><br>A monster, you say? Interesting, very interesting.<br><br>I assume you spoke to him, yes? Did he say anything else?"
// Answer Text :
"P1425187664" "(Explain to Mr. G what happened)"
// Page InformationPage2 Text :
"P1477302492" "<color deepskyblue>Personal Monster</color><br><br><color deepskyblue>Part Four: Your Own Personal Hero</color><br><br>Hrm... this is all fascinating, {HeroName}. Just fascinating. I've heard some rumors about this Maelstrom Device. Give me a minute to call an informant of mine. His name is <color yellow>Anton</color>. It can be a little... difficult to get in touch with him, so this could take a few moments. In the meantime, I shall get my secretary to get me more information about this monster."
// Answer Text :
"P3306850563" "(Wait for Mr. G's results)"
// Page InformationPage3 Text :
"P3330057813" "<color deepskyblue>Personal Monster</color><br><br><color deepskyblue>Part Four: Your Own Personal Hero</color><br><br>I apologize for the wait, {HeroName}. Anton told me what I needed to know, though my secretary was less helpful. I regret to say that I do not know the identity of this monster Eddie spoke of. I do, however, have information regarding this Maelstrom Device.<br><br>It appears that it was manufactured by <color yellow>Neuron Technologies Unlimited</color>; in other words, by Neuron. That's all the information I could currently retrieve, but it may be enough for us to move forward, yes, quite enough to move forward. I know of a lab here in Praetoria that has data files from Neuron Technologies Unlimited. I imagine you could find more information on the Maelstrom Device there. It would probably be quite simple to just walk in there and get the information.<br><br><color orange>While it <i>would</i> be simple to just walk in there and get the information on the device, there would be nothing really on your end to gain from it. No fame, no show of power, no publicity. It would <i>almost</i> be a waste of time. Unless you could get a group, say, the Resistance, to attack the lab you're going to. Why not? You'll be there anyway, you can easily swat the Resistance down while you're there. You'll get the information you need <i>and</i> look good to the people of Imperial City while doing it!"
// Answer Text :
"P3572014440" "(Explain your plan of luring the Resistance to Mr. G)"
// Page Plans Text :
"P967337425" "<color deepskyblue>Personal Monster</color><br><br><color deepskyblue>Part Four: Your Own Personal Hero</color><br><br>Excellent idea, {HeroName}, truly excellent. This is why I enjoy working with you far more than that Reese. He did not have the wit that you do. Luring the Resistance to the lab will be an excellent way to take out one of their groups here in Imperial, while also improving your own reputation. I can get on that right away. By the time you arrive there, it should be properly embroiled in chaos, very properly.<br><br>Before you go, however... there is the matter of the reporters. They wish to know what your next move is."
// Answer Text :
"P3078785193" "Tell them Eddie was brainwashed by the Resistance. I'm going to the labs to cure him."
// Answer Text :
"P1445213238" "Inform the people that I defeated several Resistance leaders to find Eddie."
// Answer Text :
"P899554896" "Tell them all signs point to Eddie being dead, but that I won't give up until I know for sure."
// Page Brainwashed Text :
"P2451192142" "<color deepskyblue>Personal Monster</color><br><br><color deepskyblue>Part Four: Your Own Personal Hero</color><br><br>The brainwashed angle? Interesting, {HeroName}, very interesting. I'll let the public know what you're up to."
// Answer Text :
"P1012416347" "Good, I'm off to the labs."
// Page ResistanceLeaders Text :
"P1498191753" "<color deepskyblue>Personal Monster</color><br><br><color deepskyblue>Part Four: Your Own Personal Hero</color><br><br>Always a good angle to bring up the Resistance leaders, always a good angle. I'll bring this to the press right away."
// Page EddieDead Text :
"P3034789311" "<color deepskyblue>Personal Monster</color><br><br><color deepskyblue>Part Four: Your Own Personal Hero</color><br><br>That will strike a chord with the public, definitely strike a chord. I'll put the word out about his possible death."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - MrGTask4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P3653577082" "<color deepskyblue>Personal Monster</color><br><br><color deepskyblue>Part Five: The New Monster</color><br><br>{HeroName}, Imperial City is alive with talk of your exploits, simply alive. Some scientists from Neuron's lab have already gone to TPN to tell them of you saving the day. Were you able to find information regarding the Maelstrom Device?"
// Answer Text :
"P3645123942" "I was. Eddie is wrong about an invasion, though I believe I learned something about his origin."
// Page InformationPage1 Text :
"P1928268975" "<color deepskyblue>Personal Monster</color><br><br><color deepskyblue>Part Five: The New Monster</color><br><br>His origin? What do you mean?"
// Answer Text :
"P3049959749" "The Maelstrom Device Eddie is wearing was stolen from the labs years ago."
// Page InformationPage2 Text :
"P1394546308" "<color deepskyblue>Personal Monster</color><br><br><color deepskyblue>Part Five: The New Monster</color><br><br>Interesting... this is most interesting. I doubt very much that Eddie is aware that this technology is stolen, yes, I quite doubt it. This means that whoever grafted the device on him stole this device right beneath Neuron's nose...<br><br>What of the monster he is chasing? Were you able to get any information regarding that?"
// Answer Text :
"P2428957728" "Very little. Something about a failed experiment with someone in the PPD."
// Page InformationPage3 Text :
"P653742035" "<color deepskyblue>Personal Monster</color><br><br><color deepskyblue>Part Five: The New Monster</color><br><br>It seems Neuron has a secret to hide there, if the report does not explain the aftermath of the experiment. Regardless, this will be important information to present to Mr. Polstra. He believes this monster is part of an invasion, wherever he is from. If you can show him evidence that his device was originally made here in <i>this</i> city, he will come to his senses, hopefully.<br><br>I've been using some sources of mine to track his positioning, and I believe he is once more down in a den of ghouls in the tunnels. He must believe that is where his monster is. Here are the coordinates where you can find him.<br><br>We have to handle one last issue before you're off, one last issue: the report to give to TPN on your current progress."
// Answer Text :
"P1097071226" "Tell them about the Syndicate and Halon labs."
// Answer Text :
"P2971753304" "Let them know that I paused my efforts with Eddie to save that lab from the Syndicate."
// Answer Text :
"P2285932823" "Tell them Warrant and I stormed the lab to protect Eddie and Praetoria from the Syndicate."
// Page Syndicate Text :
"P1185715347" "<color deepskyblue>Personal Monster</color><br><br><color deepskyblue>Part Five: The New Monster</color><br><br>Good angle, the people will be interested to know that the Syndicate had a man in Halon Labs. I'll get this information out as soon as I can.<br><br><color Paragon>Those members of the Resistance who have chosen to go deep undercover should report these events to Calvin Scott before moving forward.</color>."
// Answer Text :
"P527640739" "Great, I'm off to retrieve Eddie."
// Page Selfless Text :
"P227539175" "<color deepskyblue>Personal Monster</color><br><br><color deepskyblue>Part Five: The New Monster</color><br><br>It's always good to try to garner the compassion of the people in that manner. I'll get the word out about this.<br><br><color Paragon>Players who originally part of the Resistance can call up Calvin Scott to inform him of current events. This will begin the storyline of working undercover in the Powers line for Loyalists.</color>."
// Page Warrant Text :
"P3669265417" "<color deepskyblue>Personal Monster</color><br><br><color deepskyblue>Part Five: The New Monster</color><br><br>Oh, you ran into Warrant? Interesting. I did not think you were one to 'share the spotlight' as it were, did not think that. I'll let TPN know of this latest event.<br><br><color Paragon>Those members of the Resistance who have chosen to go deep undercover should report these events to Calvin Scott before moving forward.</color>."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - MaelstromTask4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P2517029316" "You again! Why won't you just let me find the monster?! This is to protect the people of Praetoria!"
// Answer Text :
"P4236713996" "(Show Eddie the details on the Maelstrom Device)"
// Page InformationPage1 Text :
"P1194402958" "What...? The device was made... here? In Praetoria?<br><br>But that means... {HeroName}, this changes everything! I've been a fool, the monster is minor compared to this. Do you know what all this means?! The invasion, they've known about Praetoria longer than I believed!"
// Answer Text :
"P741872994" "What is this invasion you're talking about?"
// Page InformationPage2 Text :
"P3861836545" "Where I come from, they want to destroy Praetoria and everything that it stands for. I thought all this time they made this device of mine and that <i>they</i> made that monster. But if they were able to steal this device from Neuron... it can only mean that they have more details on Praetoria than I could have possibly imagined!<br><br> I have to go speak with Cole, with White, with <i>someone</i> about this. I can't let them invade us, I <i>won't</i> let them, even if I have to go back there!"
// Answer Text :
"P3405668762" "Alright, so we can both get back to the surface now."
// Answer Text :
"P3282636627" "Before we go, Eddie, I have a question. Where are you -really- from?"
// Page TrueHome Text :
"P1399863349" "Where I'm <i>really</i> from?<br><br>So, I guess you don't believe all the talk that I'm from Old San Jose, huh? Why do you want to know, anyway?"
// Answer Text :
"P2607334456" "I helped you out this much, didn't I? I can help you further with this 'invasion', if needed."
// Page Revelation Text :
"P173366448" "Alright... but this stays between the two of us, {HeroName}. I'm from <i>another dimension</i>. That is why the Praetors are keeping these secrets about me. This other world is planning a <i>massive</i> invasion against Praetoria. I was to be one of the first agents to cross over and scout the area. That dimension... it's full of chaos and destruction; it's nothing like the world of Praetoria.<br><br>We have to do everything in our power to make sure those scum never make it through into this world, {HeroName}! Do you understand?"
// Answer Text :
"P2757110214" "I do. Now, let's get going."
// Page InformationPage3 Text :
"P2516247438" "<color orange>Almost as if on command, you hear the frenzied footsteps of Resistance soldiers bearing down on you and Polstra!</color>"
// Answer Text :
"P2431974032" "Resistance! This should be good."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - MrGTask5 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P1657735687" "The people of Imperial are thrilled to have Maelstrom back, {HeroName}, absolutely thrilled.<br><br>You're being proclaimed as a hero, someone who the people can really put their faith in to save the day. In preparation for your return, I had TPN send me the first copy of their news report on your quest to save Eddie Polstra. Care to have a look?"
// Answer Text :
"P2874153934" "Sure, let's see what they said."
// Page ResistanceReportPage Text :
"P2523646716" "<scale 1.25>{HeroName} Saves Edward Polstra, Thwarts Resistance Plot</scale><br><br>Earlier today, {HeroName} rescued Edward Polstra from the clutches of the Resistance, and we at TPN were with {Hero.gender=male him|her} every step of the way during this bold investigation.<br><br>It all began when {HeroName} had a possible lead on Edward Polstra's location. {Hero.gender=male He|She} descended into the tunnels to find Edward and discovered, to our horror, that Edward had been kidnapped by high-ranking officials in the Resistance! Of course, {HeroName} was not afraid of facing the Resistance, having carved a path through many of them already!"
// Answer Text :
"P4017843039" "(Continue reading)"
// Page GhoulsReportPage Text :
"P2918001801" "<scale 1.25>{HeroName} Saves Edward Polstra, Thwarts Resistance Plot</scale><br><br>Earlier today, {HeroName} rescued Edward Polstra from the clutches of the Resistance, and we at TPN were with {Hero.gender=male him|her} every step of the way during this bold investigation.<br><br>It all began when {HeroName} had a possible lead on Edward Polstra's location. {Hero.gender=male He|She} descended into the tunnels to find Edward. Though there was no trace of Edward Polstra, {HeroName} stopped a horde of Ghouls from getting into Imperial City. We estimate that {HeroName}, alone, held back over two hundred ghouls!"
// Page CampaignReportPage Text :
"P421216566" "<scale 1.25>{HeroName} Saves Edward Polstra, Thwarts Resistance Plot</scale><br><br>Earlier today, {HeroName} rescued Edward Polstra from the clutches of the Resistance, and we at TPN were with {Hero.gender=male him|her} every step of the way during this bold investigation.<br><br>It all began when {HeroName} had a possible lead on Edward Polstra's location. {Hero.gender=male He|She} descended into the tunnels to find Edward. {HeroName} could not find Edward at first. However, the experience helped to forge a new goal for {HeroName}: to make the tunnels a safer place. Reports say that {HeroName} saved several civilians who were trapped down there, while also bringing in members of the Resistance who were trying to tame wild ghouls for their own ends!"
// Page BrainWashedPage Text :
"P3666495995" "{HeroName} continued {Hero.gender=male his|her} search for Edward Polstra, only to uncover a shocking revelation: Edward Polstra had been <i>brainwashed</i> by the Resistance! This was something that {HeroName} expected, of course! Without missing a beat, {HeroName} declared that the solution was simple: one of Neuron's labs in Imperial City would hold the answer for Eddie's condition."
// Page LeaderReportPage Text :
"P2853082870" "{HeroName} pushed forward on the search for Edward, confronting one of the major leaders of the Resistance in Imperial. This leader tried to sway {HeroName} with petty gifts and insults to our great Emperor Cole, but {HeroName} was not someone who would listen to such nonsense. {Hero.gender=male He|She} took down the leader, along with fifty other members of the Resistance, all by {Hero.gender=male himself|herself}! Yet with that finished, Edward Polstra was no where to be found! {HeroName} had one last lead: one of Neuron's labs in Imperial City. With this, {HeroName} could discover Edward Polstra's location!"
// Page DeathReportPage Text :
"P30860569" "{HeroName} fought through an almost endless amount of Resistance in the tunnels, all of them threatening to do great harm to our fair Imperial City. A few members of the Resistance were even plotting to sink part of the island! Though the Resistance were no match for {HeroName}'s true power, they made a terrifying claim: that Edward Polstra was dead, killed by their hands.<br><br> {HeroName} refused to believe this, however, and decided there was one place that {Hero.gender=male he|she} could go to get answers: one of Neuron's labs in Imperial City. {HeroName} could use the resources there to try to find Edward Polstra's exact location."
// Page HalonLabPAge Text :
"P2577529142" "{HeroName} put on an amazing display in Neuron's lab when {Hero.gender=male he|she} walked in to find it was under attack by the Syndicate! Wasting no time, {HeroName} dispatched the vile members of the Syndicate, preventing them from blowing up the entire building. <br><br>{HeroName} also arrested Michael Haworth, the CTO of Halon Labs. He is currently being held by the PPD and is awaiting judgment on his sentence for collaborating with the Syndicate. Provost Marchand has commented that no mercy will be shown to someone in such a high position of power within the city.<br><br>Meanwhile, {HeroName} obtained what was needed in Neuron's lab and was able to finally locate our dear Edward Polstra in the sewers! A horde of Resistance descended upon the two, but {HeroName} bravely fought them off, allowing a badly injured Edward Polstra to get away.<br><br>Edward Polstra is now back in the safety of Imperial City, all thanks to the work done by {HeroName}. I think it's safe to say that Imperial City has a new hero, and {Hero.gender=male his|her} name is {HeroName}!"
// Answer Text :
"P1098253349" "Hrm, pretty good article, Mr. G."
// Page SelflessPage Text :
"P1637742880" "{HeroName} had already been through enough in the tunnels, fighting armies of Resistance and Ghouls. As usual, though, {HeroName} once again saved the day in Neuron's lab, despite <i>all</i> that {Hero.gender=male he|she} had already done for us. The Syndicate were invading Neuron's lab, threatening to unleash several dirty bombs. {HeroName} disarmed the bombs and took down the Syndicate, saving the entire lab and part of Imperial City from certain destruction.<br><br>{HeroName} obtained what was needed in Neuron's lab and was able to finally locate our dear Edward Polstra in the sewers! A horde of Resistance descended upon the two, but {HeroName} bravely fought them off, allowing a badly injured Edward Polstra to get away.<br><br>Edward Polstra is now back in the safety of Imperial City, all thanks to the work done by {HeroName}. I think it's safe to say that Imperial City has a new hero, and {Hero.gender=male his|her} name is {HeroName}!"
// Page WarrantPage Text :
"P3391904429" "{HeroName} encountered Warrant, another member of Powers Division, inside of Neuron's lab. Warrant was was trying to fight off the Syndicate, who had broken into the facility. Despite his best efforts, Warrant could not push them back. It was only thanks to {HeroName}'s intervention that the tide was turned. {HeroName} and Warrant went on to put down all the invading Syndicate, safely securing the lab for the good of Praetoria. The two parted ways, Warrant having to go recover from his wounds.<br><br>{HeroName}, however, was far from done. {Hero.gender=male He|She} obtained what was needed in Neuron's lab and was able to finally locate our dear Edward Polstra in the sewers! A horde of Resistance descended upon the two, but {HeroName} bravely fought them off, allowing a badly injured Edward Polstra to get away.<br><br>Edward Polstra is now back in the safety of Imperial City, all thanks to the work done by {HeroName}. I think it's safe to say that Imperial City has a new hero, and {Hero.gender=male his|her} name is {HeroName}!"
// Page FinishedArticle Text :
"P1364027988" "Yes, I believe it fits you perfectly, {HeroName}. Take some time to bask in this, then give me a call. I'm finishing up a few loose ends, just a few. I think you'll be very interested to see what I've come up with."
// Answer Text :
"P828800002" "Alright, sounds good."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - CalvinScott 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P2417293682" "{HeroName}, thank goodness. I thought for a while that you had really fallen in with the Loyalists. I have to say, you are definitely playing your part well enough.<br><br>I'm very impressed, to say the least; no one will think that <i>you</i> are actually working for the Resistance. From the news reports coming in, they say that you're on the trail of Eddie Polstra, correct?"
// Answer Text :
"P209448712" "That's right. Do you have any information on him?"
// Page InformationPage1 Text :
"P863143894" "Very little, I'm afraid. All I know is that he's not from around here. A young man named <color yellow>Robert Flores</color> helped us get information regarding Eddie. Tyrant intends to use Eddie as much as possible for his own ends. I suspect there's something that makes Eddie special, though I can't put my finger on it..."
// Answer Text :
"P2087247016" "I heard that Praetor Tilman can't read his mind. That's probably it."
// Page InformationPage2 Text :
"P2592058839" "Ah, you're right! That small little detail makes him <i>very</i> valuable to Cole. Tilman can track nearly anyone in the organization - except for those of us who have protection. The fact that Eddie cannot be tracked by her makes him Cole's wild card. You're going down to see him now, right?"
// Answer Text :
"P621802116" "I am. Anything you want me to find out?"
// Page InformationPage3 Text :
"P1643186854" "Hrm... we'll have to be careful about what you ask him. We can't give away your position as one of us; if Eddie knew you were part of the Resistance, he would attack you on the spot.<br><br>Try to find out from Eddie where he's <i>really</i> from. It'll just be simple curiosity on your end. If you can find that out, call me again in the future and let me know. We need to keep our contacts as brief as possible, you may never know when someone is listening in."
// Answer Text :
"P4177638146" "Understood. I'll see what I can do."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1907414584" "I've used my resources to try to locate Mr. Polstra. It's been rather difficult pinning down his exact location, <i>rather</i> difficult. His speciality is being immune to <color yellow>Praetor Tilman's psychic powers</color>. This allows him to stay completely 'off the grid', so to say. I have no doubt, however, that Mr. Polstra is out fighting for the safety of Praetoria, wherever he is. And you will look just as good when you rescue him, yes?<br><br>Enough with the idle chitchat though, enough with that. We don't have an exact location, but I do know of where he may have been last seen. Some of my sources within the Praetorian government say that he was last seen fighting off hordes of ghouls in the nearby tunnels. This would be the best place for you to check, {HeroName}."
// AcceptString :
"P2710436702" "Excellent. Alert the press that I'm beginning my search."
// SendOffString :
"P2362639170" "I've already done so, in the interest of keeping things flowing smoothly. While you are out searching, TPN will be running a piece detailing the beginnings of your search, and that you swear to leave no stone unturned until Eddie Polstra is rescued. I believe it will catch the attention of many people here within Imperial City, many people. When you have some more information on these matters, feel free to call me. I'll be waiting."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P565108345" "<color deepskyblue>Part Two: Among Monsters</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound2_Part1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
