"P3860411695" "Track Eddie's Last Location"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P56691865" "It's best that you get moving, {HeroName}. Time may or may not be of the essence."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P764385269" "The rotting stench of ghouls fills the air, even this far above the tunnels. Looks like you'll be going deep into their territory to find Eddie..."

